g class=\"font-semibold\">tamper test</strong>. It was refused on-chain, so it has no entry index and appears in no agent’s record.</p></article></section><section class=\"surface flex w-full flex-col gap-5 p-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Check it without us</p><h2 class=\"heading text-xl\">Recompute everything from public RPC data.</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed\">The verifier is read-only and takes no keys. It fetches the transaction, recomputes the hashes, recovers the signer and compares it against the TEE signer registered on-chain.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Verify the accepted transaction</span><div class=\"border-border-strong bg-muted/40 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal text-muted-foreground size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><code class=\"tnum min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs whitespace-nowrap\">pnpm fief-verify --tx 0xdecf4eed72087b518ae9212f0774a070a8776d303ff0f96e0e04aa96e3fffe98</code><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy verify command\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground focus-visible:ring-ring/60 inline-flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\"></span></button></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1.5\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Verify the rejected transaction</span><div class=\"border-border-strong bg-muted/40 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border px-3 py-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal text-muted-foreground size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><code class=\"tnum min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto font-mono text-xs whitespace-nowrap\">pnpm fief-verify --tx 0x210d43176b9a950d21b16c778af1de419a62e4f4da1bc21239433b9f63a4e21c</code><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy verify command\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground focus-visible:ring-ring/60 inline-flex size-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\"></span></button></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://chainscan.0g.ai/tx/0xdecf4eed72087b518ae9212f0774a070a8776d303ff0f96e0e04aa96e3fffe98\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-slot=\"button\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border-border-strong hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground h-8 gap-1.5 px-3.5 text-[0.8rem] has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5\">Accepted on ChainScan<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://chainscan.0g.ai/tx/0x210d43176b9a950d21b16c778af1de419a62e4f4da1bc21239433b9f63a4e21c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-slot=\"button\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border-border-strong hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground h-8 gap-1.5 px-3.5 text-[0.8rem] has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5\">Rejected on ChainScan<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><a data-slot=\"button\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border-border-strong hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground h-8 gap-1.5 px-3.5 text-[0.8rem] has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5\" href=\"/verify\">Paste your own hash</a></div></section><section class=\"flex w-full max-w-[68ch] flex-col gap-4\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The mechanism</p><h2 class=\"heading text-xl\">Why the record cannot be quietly rewritten</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">The signature covers a hash of the request and a hash of the response together. The request holds the secret strategy, so it is never published — only its hash goes on-chain, sealed. The response is public by design, because it <em>is</em> the decision. The contract rebuilds the expected commitment from its own state and compares it byte-for-byte against the response before accepting anything.</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">This is stricter than the reference client. 0G’s own SDK trusts the signed text the provider returns and only recovers the signer from it. Fief recomputes the response hash on-chain and rebuilds that text from the actual bytes first, so a provider returning text that does not match the real request and response passes the SDK but fails here.</p></section><section class=\"grid w-full items-stretch gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"surface border-l-accepted flex h-full flex-col gap-3 border-l-2 p-5\"><h3 class=\"heading text-accepted-fg flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>What this proves</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The response was produced by the TEE signer registered in 0G’s inference serving contract.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The response bytes submitted on-chain hash to the text that signer signed.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The run declared this agent, this sealed strategy commitment, this epoch, this slot and this input.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The slot was scheduled before the outcome was knowable, and it accepts exactly one commit, so the entry cannot be a replay or a late addition.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The entry is append-only and survives rental, transfer and reseal.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"surface border-l-rejected flex h-full flex-col gap-3 border-l-2 border-dashed p-5\"><h3 class=\"heading text-rejected-fg flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x size-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg>What it does not</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rejected-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><span>That the decisions were profitable. Fief records provenance, never performance.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rejected-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><span>That the request actually contained the sealed strategy — the commitment is declared on the response side. An authorized request audit closes this, and is a product feature rather than a footnote.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rejected-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><span>Anything about the ERC-7857 draft verifier’s cryptographic strength. Record integrity does not depend on it.</span></li><li class=\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x text-rejected-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg><span>That a renter cannot approximate the strategy by observing many outputs over time. That is a documented residual risk.</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"surface flex w-full flex-col gap-3 p-6\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Stated plainly</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed\">Fief proves provenance, not profitability. A record shows which sealed model produced which decision — it is not evidence that the decisions were good.</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed\">Request commitment sealed, auditable under authorized access<!-- -->.</p><a data-slot=\"button\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border-border-strong hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground hover:border-foreground/30 aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground h-8 gap-1.5 px-3.5 text-[0.8rem] has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5 self-start\" href=\"/about\">Full limits and threat model</a></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class=\"border-border mt-auto border-t\"><div class=\"container-page flex flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed\">Strategy sealed on 0G Storage, never on the public chain<!-- -->; <!-- -->decisions attested by 0G TeeML<!-- -->; <!-- -->request commitment sealed, auditable under authorized access<!-- -->.</p><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-2 md:justify-end\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"https://github.com/winsznx/fief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\">GitHub</a><a href=\"https://docs.0g.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\">0G docs</a><a class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\" href=\"/verify\">Verify a transaction</a><a class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\" href=\"/about\">Honest limits</a></nav></div><div class=\"border-border flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs\">Provenance only. No custody, no execution, no verification of profit or loss.</p><code class=\"text-muted-foreground border-border shrink-0 rounded-sm border px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs\">pnpm fief-verify --tx &lt;hash&gt;</code></div></div></footer><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\" data-react-aria-top-layer=\"true\"></section><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0i7-u46n5dwv1.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[96923,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3c9jkoppk_ssg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3gfc9935i2hyt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mvms5l01zt68.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0a6ea2ozua0ig.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0rgz279io978f.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/40g7prjkx48wy.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1m_adzyzc3xyr.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/22jwxos-9dwi7.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n3:I[13703,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3c9jkoppk_ssg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3gfc9935i2hyt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mvms5l01zt68.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0a6ea2ozua0ig.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0rgz279io978f.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/40g7prjkx48wy.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1m_adzyzc3xyr.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/22jwxos-9dwi7.js\\\"],\\\"TopNav\\\"]\\n4:I[82151,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3c9jkoppk_ssg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3gfc9935i2hyt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mvms5l01zt68.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0a6ea2ozua0ig.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0rgz279io978f.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/40g7prjkx48wy.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1m_adzyzc3xyr.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/22jwxos-9dwi7.js\\\"],\\\"NetworkGuard\\\"]\\n5:I[71675,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi