se was produced by the TEE signer registered in 0G’s inference serving contract.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$24:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The response was produced by the TEE signer registered in 0G’s inference serving contract.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The response bytes submitted on-chain hash to the text that signer signed.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$24:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The response bytes submitted on-chain hash to the text that signer signed.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The run declared this agent, this sealed strategy commitment, this epoch, this slot and this input.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$24:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The run declared this agent, this sealed strategy commitment, this epoch, this slot and this input.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The slot was scheduled before the outcome was knowable, and it accepts exactly one commit, so the entry cannot be a replay or a late addition.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$24:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The slot was scheduled before the outcome was knowable, and it accepts exactly one commit, so the entry cannot be a replay or a late addition.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The entry is append-only and survives rental, transfer and reseal.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$24:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The entry is append-only and survives rental, transfer and reseal.\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"surface border-l-rejected flex h-full flex-col gap-3 border-l-2 border-dashed p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"heading text-rejected-fg flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M18 6 6 18\",\"key\":\"1bl5f8\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m6 6 12 12\",\"key\":\"d8bk6v\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-x size-4 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],\"What it does not\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"That the decisions were profitable. Fief records provenance, never performance.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"iconNode\":\"$24:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-x text-rejected-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"That the decisions were profitable. Fief records provenance, never performance.\"}]]}],[\"$