it is never published — only its hash goes on-chain, sealed. The response is public by design, because it \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"is\"}],\" the decision. The contract rebuilds the expected commitment from its own state and compares it byte-for-byte against the response before accepting anything.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"This is stricter than the reference client. 0G’s own SDK trusts the signed text the provider returns and only recovers the signer from it. Fief recomputes the response hash on-chain and rebuilds that text from the actual bytes first, so a provider returning text that does not match the real request and response passes the SDK but fails here.\"}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"grid w-full items-stretch gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"surface border-l-accepted flex h-full flex-col gap-3 border-l-2 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"heading text-accepted-fg flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\",\"key\":\"1gmf2c\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-check size-4 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],\"What this proves\"]}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"The response was produced by the TEE signer registered in 0G’s inference serving contract.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$c:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The response was produced by the TEE signer registered in 0G’s inference serving contract.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The response bytes submitted on-chain hash to the text that signer signed.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$c:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The response bytes submitted on-chain hash to the text that signer signed.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The run declared this agent, this sealed strategy commitment, this epoch, this slot and this input.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$c:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The run declared this agent, this sealed strategy commitment, this epoch, this slot and this input.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The slot was scheduled before the outcome was knowable, and it accepts exactly one commit, so the entry cannot be a replay or a late addition.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$c:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria-hidden\":true}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"The slot was scheduled before the outcome was knowable, and it accepts exactly one commit, so the entry cannot be a replay or a late addition.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"The entry is append-only and survives rental, transfer and reseal.\",{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground flex gap-2 text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$c:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-check text-accepted-fg mt-0.5 size-3.5 shrink-0\",\"aria